1,2011,57,114,27],[18712,17.8,2011,53,120,25]],"links":[["Oldham County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/texas/oldham-county"],["ARC or PLC in Oldham County","/arc-plc/texas/oldham-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 44 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 176% of normal in May to June but only 33% in February to March. So far in 2026 it has run short, with February to March at 1% and March to April at 26% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
